  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">APEC Support (predecessor to Australia&#x2019;s APEC Support Program)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding under this initiative supported the Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) forum to ensure that the APEC developing economies were able to fully benefit from their membership of APEC through a variety of different activities. Support under this initiative strengthened the APEC Secretariat and included annual contributions to the APEC Support Fund for capacity-building projects, the provision of a Development Program Specialist within the APEC Secretariat, flexible contributions to the APEC Effectiveness Grant to support project quality, and annual contributions to the APEC Secretariat&#x2019;s Policy Support Unit; implementation of a project management reform agenda that Australia led through APEC&#x2019;s Budget and Management Committee.</narrative>
  </description>
